{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fbb5ffca91b695d6","name":"Gladius-Class Light Freighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-fbb5ffca91b695d6","title":"Gladius-Class Light Freighter","revision":20177,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:21:32Z","sha256":"0c3da51a8b3b9085e89afb849195295a1b3920f3cf1d633ef5989edf72242ebc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20177","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gladius-Class%20Light%20Freighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fbb5ffca91b695d6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sector Rangers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sector_Rangers","referenceId":"reference:82cdaa1d1f56c749"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter is the spiritual descendant of transport models such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Firespray-31 Patrol Craft"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Firespray-31_Patrol_Craft","referenceId":"reference:4332ec6d77d7f80b"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["S40K ",{"tag":"i","children":["Phoenix Hawk"]},"-Class Light Pinnace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/S40K_Phoenix_Hawk-Class_Light_Pinnace","referenceId":"reference:fb65ca425d6adc7b"},". Featuring a round, flat ventral section and a smooth, curved body design, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter is a sleek ship that is often used by planetary defense forces and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sector Rangers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sector_Rangers","referenceId":"reference:82cdaa1d1f56c749"}," throughout the galaxy. Thanks to deals brokered with Kuat Systems Engineering's parent company, Kuat Drive Yards, the Empire allow manufacture and sale of this ship in exchange for favorable contracts on the manufacture of Imperial vessels.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter is a relatively nimble Space Transport that is often used as a scout vessel or system patrol craft. Though its dorsal-mounted Quad ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," are impressive, the ship does not have the defensive systems to fight off pirates, raiders, or larger criminal fleets. Typically, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter performs long-range scouting and, upon spotting a hostile vessel, immediately notes the position of the target before returning to its base of operations for reinforcements. If pursued, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter uses its Quad ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," to fend off pursuers long enough to reach safety. This Space Transport does have a fast ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," as well, and law enforcement organizations train their pilots to use the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter to make in-system microjumps to reach home more quickly.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighters often find their way into the hands of bounty hunters who appreciate both the speed of the vessel as well as its armaments. Additionally, bounty hunters (many of whom are loners by nature) can operate the ship themselves. The circular cockpit area makes moving from one station to another easy and allows the various control systems to be spread out, keeping the command console from becoming cluttered.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The bounty hunter ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jor Torlin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jor_Torlin","referenceId":"reference:15a584d0948a5301"}," uses a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter, called The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Raider"]},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Gladius"]},"-Class Light Freighter Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +0; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 16 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 27; +12 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 140; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 30; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 77\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","c